    const activePerspective = perspective === CameraPerspective.AUTO 
      ? (inferredPerspective ? `${inferredPerspective} (Inferred)` : "Eye Level (Default)")
      : perspective;

    const activeAspectRatio = aspectRatio === AspectRatio.AUTO ? "1:1" : aspectRatio;

    let operationalRules = "";

    if (mode === 'BOARD') {
      // --- BOARD MODE RULES (STRICT 9-SHOT VARIATION) ---
      operationalRules = `[ BOARD MODE: 9-SHOT CAMPAIGN GENERATION ]
----------------------------------------------------------------------
SYSTEM INSTRUCTION: Generate a SINGLE high-resolution image containing EXACTLY 9 distinct product shots arranged in a clean, unified grid (3x3).

[ PRODUCT SOURCE AUTHORITY - ABSOLUTE ]
• The uploaded Product Image is the ONLY valid source for the product's appearance.
• The Reference Image is for STYLE, MOOD, and LIGHTING ONLY.
• STRICTLY FORBIDDEN: Do NOT use, recreate, or blend the product from the Reference Image into the output.
• If a product appears in the Reference Image, IGNORE IT COMPLETELY. Use the uploaded product instead.
