[ DIVERSITY ENFORCEMENT - MANDATORY FRAMING SET ]
You must generate exactly 9 shots. Each shot MUST strictly follow one of the following unique framing rules. Do not repeat any framing type.

MANDATORY FRAMING RULES (One for each panel):
1. Front Center Hero – straight-on, centered, medium distance
2. Low Angle Power Shot – low perspective emphasizing presence
3. Top-Down Flat Composition – overhead flat-lay framing
4. Close-Up Detail Crop – tight crop focusing on texture or detail
5. Wide Context Shot – wide frame with product smaller in scene
6. Diagonal Dynamic Frame – diagonal composition creating motion
7. Negative Space Composition – product placed off-center with empty space
8. Back or Side Profile Shot – side or partial back view
9. Creative Elevation / Floating Concept – conceptual shot within the same theme

MANDATORY EXECUTION:
